<header><p class="st-kicker">other · Greece and the Aegean</p><h1 class="st-title">Hellenic Alliance</h1><p class="st-meta">481 BCE – 478 BCE (approx.) · capital Corinth</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">The alliance of Greek states, led by Sparta, that defeated the invasion of Xerxes at Salamis, Plataea and Mycale in 480-479 BCE.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>In autumn 481 BCE, as the Persian king <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/xerxes-i">Xerxes</a> gathered his army in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/asia-minor">Asia Minor</a>, delegates of the Greek states willing to resist met at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/isthmus-of-corinth">Isthmus of Corinth</a>. They swore an alliance, ended their own feuds, including the war between <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/athens">Athens</a> and <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/aegina">Aegina</a>, and sent envoys to seek help from <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/argos">Argos</a>, <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/syracuse">Syracuse</a>, <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/corcyra">Corcyra</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/crete">Crete</a>, with little success.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p>The alliance had a council of delegates (probouloi) meeting at the Isthmus, but command lay with <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/sparta">Sparta</a>, which led on land and, through <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/eurybiades">Eurybiades</a>, at sea, although <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/themistocles">Themistocles</a>' Athenian fleet was the largest. Some 31 states are named on the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/serpent-column">Serpent Column</a> dedicated at <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/delphi">Delphi</a> after the war. Members who had sided with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/persia">Persia</a> were threatened with punishment.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p>After victories at Salamis (480 BCE) and <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/plataea">Plataea</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-mycale">Mycale</a> (479 BCE), the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/greeks">Greeks</a> carried the war to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/aegean">Aegean</a>. The arrogance of the Spartan regent <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pausanias-general">Pausanias</a> at <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/byzantium">Byzantium</a> in 478 BCE led the Ionian allies to turn to <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/athens">Athens</a>, which founded the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/delian-league">Delian League</a>. The alliance itself lingered formally until 461 BCE.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><div class="st-emblem" role="img" aria-label="other, 481 BCE – 478 BCE (approx.)"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M26 24 H74 V52 Q74 74 50 84 Q26 74 26 52 Z"/><path d="M50 24 V84 M26 46 H74"/></svg><p class="st-emblem-type">other</p><p class="st-emblem-region">Greece and the Aegean</p><div class="st-span" aria-hidden="true"><span class="st-span-bar" style="left:50.13%;width:1.20%"></span></div><div class="st-span-axis" aria-hidden="true"><span>3000 BCE</span><span>1 CE</span><span>2000</span></div></div><dl class="st-facts"><dt>Years</dt><dd>481 BCE – 478 BCE (approx.)</dd><dt>Century</dt><dd><a href="/centuries/5th-century-bce">5th century BCE</a></dd><dt>Type</dt><dd>other</dd><dt>Character</dt><dd>bureaucratic</dd><dt>Capital</dt><dd>Corinth</dd><dt>Rulers</dt><dd>Leonidas I, Themistocles, Pausanias</dd><dt>Religion</dt><dd>Ancient Greek religion</dd><dt>Language</dt><dd>Ancient Greek</dd><dt>Today</dt><dd><a href="/countries/greece">Greece</a></dd><dt>Also</dt><dd>Hellenic League of 481 BC, Greek Alliance</dd></dl><figure class="st-locator"><a href="/atlas?year=-480&amp;focus=hellenic-alliance" aria-label="Hellenic Alliance on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="5252 814 640 512" role="img" aria-label="Map: where Hellenic Alliance lay"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-tie" d="M5572 1070L5591 1068"/><path class="map-dot-n" d="M5591 1068h0"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M5572 1070h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M5572 1070h0"/></svg></a>